2082
01:23:07.971 --> 01:23:09.671
-"Jangan jadi kuda nil…"
-Lari, Ji-won!

2083
01:23:09.738 --> 01:23:11.605
Nombor lapan?

2084
01:23:12.171 --> 01:23:13.538
JI-WON MULAKAN BERLUMBA

2085
